{"id":"e7fa65c4b5","t":"My Wife Waited in the Wheat Fields","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/large_1000247024-193x278.jpg","n":23,"l":23,"s":["ml","az","mg"],"k":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields","az":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields","mg":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields"},"u":1795078350226,"desc":"كان زواجنا مدبرًا. لذلك، هربت ليلة زفافنا. تخليت عن اسمي وعشت في المنفى لعشر سنوات طويلة. لم أعد إلى المنزل إلا عندما تلقيت نبأ وفاة والدي. كنت متأكدًا من أنها ستكون قد رحلت منذ زمن طويل الآن. زوجة لم أرَ وجهها إلا مرة واحدة. ومع ذلك، ها هي ذي. تبدو جميلة كما كانت يوم رحيلي.","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["خيال","دراما","رومانسى","شونين"],"src":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields","az":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields","mg":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/1/","az":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/series/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/2/"},"3":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/3/"},"4":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/4/"},"5":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/5/"},"6":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/6/"},"7":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/7/"},"8":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/8/"},"9":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/9/"},"10":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/10/"},"11":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields/11/"},"12":{"ml":"my-wife-waited-in-the-wheat-fields|/manga/